<title>JAPAN: Asahi Printing -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Asahi Printing -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.80		vs	    6.90</p>
<p> Operating	  586    million	  vs	  701    million</p>
<p> Current	    602    million	  vs	  715    million</p>
<p> Net		  295    million	  vs	  344    million</p>
<p> EPS		   25.58 yen	  vs	   31.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Printing and Packaging Co Ltd is a printer and manufacturer of wrapping materials.</p>
</text>
